{"unit_id":"ASUKAq01__dsh-background-image#feature-image-upload","repo":"ASUKAq01/dsh-background-image","commit":"e91e3a16daee71699f7626295f98e8ea21fa9a52","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Background Image 的功能「图片导入」：用户可从文件选择器挑选图片，也可将图片拖入预览区域。客户端会在浏览器内缩放和重新编码，再将结果用于背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:435-475","client.js:557-590"]}
