{"unit_id":"ASUKAq01__dsh-background-image#caveat-local-storage","repo":"ASUKAq01/dsh-background-image","commit":"e91e3a16daee71699f7626295f98e8ea21fa9a52","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Background Image 将压缩图片和外观设置写入当前浏览器的 localStorage；清除站点数据会删除这些内容。（见 client.js:292-306）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:292-306","client.js:383-407"]}
